                        <locus>(fols. 1r-2v)</locus>
                        <author key="person_32836216">William of Saint-Cloud</author>
                        <title key="work_7548">Almanach planetarum</title>
                        <note>Fragment: tables for January 1293/4 - April 1294. In contrast to the other two known manuscripts of the tables (Bibliotheca Apostolica Vaticana MS. Vat. lat. 4572 and BnF Latin 16210) our copy does not include facing pages with astrological tables concerning planetary aspects. See <title>William of Saint-Cloud: Almanach Planetarum. An edition of the canons, a few samples from the tables, and a foray into the numbers</title>, ed. Fritz Saaby Pedersen, Cahiers de l'Institut du Moyen-Âge grec et latin 83 (2014). Pedersen did not know of the present fragments.</note>
                        <rubric><locus>(fol. 2r) </locus>Almanach planetarum ad annum domini 1294 ... </rubric>
                        
                     </msItem>
                     
