                        <locus>(fol. 3r-v)</locus><title type="desc" key="work_10376">Astronomical / astrological calendar</title>
                     <note>Fragment: part of the monthly tables for January (showing conjunctions and oppositions for four Metonic cycles, the first being 1462-1480; the figures do not exactly correspond to those in the printed editions of either John Somer or Nicholas Lynn) and February (showing inter alia the number of the day, medietas noctis, medietas diei, altitudo meridiana, ortus solis, horae planetarum)</note></msItem>
